  "description": "One night when I was completely drunk, I accidentally ended up on top of a guy. As luck would have it, he was not only South Korea’s hottest actor but also my ex-boyfriend, the one I never wanted to see again! On top of that... \n\n*“You wrote this story about us. So, of course, I’m the male lead.”* \n\nNot only is my script, filled with innocent memories, being turned into a drama, but my ex-boyfriend, the real-life subject of the story, is taking on the lead role?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
